WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.630
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:19.900 --> 00:21.733
In a bit I'll give you a bath.

3
00:24.706 --> 00:25.706
What?

4
00:27.333 --> 00:28.600
Xu Feiyu.

5
00:29.100 --> 00:30.100
Mom!

6
00:30.700 --> 00:31.900
How come you're back?

7
00:32.800 --> 00:35.026
You've never come home this late before.

8
00:36.633 --> 00:37.633
I…

9
00:42.933 --> 00:45.033
So you're Yong Qi's junior?

10
00:46.866 --> 00:47.266
Auntie

11
00:47.400 --> 00:48.400
I'm Song Yi.

12
00:49.066 --> 00:51.166
I hear you live in Singapore.

13
00:51.333 --> 00:52.666
What brings you here?

14
00:53.400 --> 00:54.266
Surely not just to

15
00:54.267 --> 00:55.566
be our family's caregiver?

16
00:56.600 --> 00:57.600
I…

17
00:57.933 --> 00:59.866
I just came to help Yong Qi out.

18
01:00.433 --> 01:01.466
I was free anyway.

19
01:03.200 --> 01:04.533
Both of you come and sit.

20
01:20.633 --> 01:21.766
You sit too.

21
01:31.933 --> 01:33.699
Xu Feiyu used to have

22
01:33.700 --> 01:35.233
a skin contact allergy.

23
01:36.100 --> 01:37.100
You know about it?

24
01:38.833 --> 01:39.133
Yes

25
01:39.400 --> 01:40.400
I know.

26
01:40.800 --> 01:41.800
And now

27
01:42.633 --> 01:43.633
is it gone?

28
01:46.000 --> 01:47.000
It's much better.

29
01:47.533 --> 01:48.800
Maybe I'm just

30
01:49.000 --> 01:49.833
slow to react

31
01:49.933 --> 01:50.933
so

32
01:51.333 --> 01:52.933
he's not allergic to me.

33
02:11.866 --> 02:12.866
Song Yi.

34
02:13.766 --> 02:15.733
Thank you for looking after Xu Feiyu.

35
02:16.800 --> 02:17.633
This

36
02:17.766 --> 02:20.432
is a tie clip I brought back from Germany.

37
02:20.433 --> 02:21.666
It looks quite nice.

38
02:21.933 --> 02:22.933
It's for you.

39
02:24.100 --> 02:25.100
No thank you, Auntie.

40
02:25.300 --> 02:27.165
I never wear suits.

41
02:27.166 --> 02:28.166
I'd never use it.

42
02:28.733 --> 02:30.765
Then take a look at these trinkets,

43
02:30.766 --> 02:32.266
see if there's one you like.

44
02:32.533 --> 02:34.032
Think of it as a little

45
02:34.033 --> 02:35.033
token from me.

46
02:49.333 --> 02:50.566
Pick this one.

47
02:51.733 --> 02:52.733
Thank you.

48
03:00.066 --> 03:01.832
You've had a hard few days.

49
03:01.833 --> 03:02.932
As for your fee

50
03:02.933 --> 03:04.499
I'll pay you double.

51
03:04.500 --> 03:05.733
You're too kind, Auntie.

52
03:06.000 --> 03:07.466
I only did what I should.

53
03:08.233 --> 03:08.800
Mom.

54
03:09.100 --> 03:11.366
You could've told me you were coming home first.

55
03:11.433 --> 03:13.400
Look what time you got home.

56
03:13.833 --> 03:16.300
Your eyes aren't healed. You need more rest.

57
03:18.100 --> 03:19.100
Go on.

58
03:19.266 --> 03:20.733
Go rest in your room.

59
03:23.400 --> 03:24.400
Careful.

60
03:26.133 --> 03:27.200
All right.

61
03:28.300 --> 03:29.733
I'll go to bed then.

62
03:58.700 --> 03:59.700
Song Yi.

63
04:01.900 --> 04:03.100
Come here a moment.

64
04:21.500 --> 04:22.833
Have a drink with me.

65
04:25.600 --> 04:26.166
Yes.

66
04:26.166 --> 04:27.166
Auntie.

67
04:39.500 --> 04:41.233
You remind me of a friend of mine.

68
04:44.300 --> 04:45.966
He's in Singapore too.

69
04:46.733 --> 04:47.733
As it happens

70
04:47.966 --> 04:49.100
his surname is Song too.

71
04:51.066 --> 04:52.133
Is that so?

72
04:52.733 --> 04:54.200
Singapore is a big place.

73
04:54.800 --> 04:56.000
We probably

74
04:56.366 --> 04:57.366
never met.

75
05:03.233 --> 05:05.100
Does Song Yang know you're here?

76
05:06.533 --> 05:07.999
Do you plan to go on

77
05:08.000 --> 05:09.200
hiding it from Xu Feiyu?

78
05:11.100 --> 05:12.833
Did Yong Qi tell you everything?

79
05:13.100 --> 05:14.100
Yong Qi?

80
05:15.266 --> 05:16.900
She's not that obedient.

81
05:17.400 --> 05:18.866
You probably don't remember.

82
05:19.133 --> 05:21.433
Ten years ago I went to Singapore.

83
05:21.666 --> 05:22.833
I saw you from afar.

84
05:23.333 --> 05:25.033
The day Song Yang left prison.

85
05:26.066 --> 05:27.366
You saw me?

86
05:27.933 --> 05:29.432
Back then

87
05:29.433 --> 05:30.733
you were still just

88
05:30.933 --> 05:32.766
a little crybaby.

89
05:33.200 --> 05:35.100
But I remember your eyes.

90
05:35.600 --> 05:38.000
On guard against everyone.

91
05:39.200 --> 05:41.100
I know that look far too well.

92
05:42.633 --> 05:44.233
Just like Xu Feiyu's.

93
05:49.466 --> 05:50.500
Auntie Xu

94
05:51.833 --> 05:54.133
why did my old man leave without a word?

95
05:57.300 --> 05:59.133
Is that what you came here for?

96
06:00.666 --> 06:02.700
That's one of the reasons, yes.

97
06:03.033 --> 06:04.300
That question

98
06:04.533 --> 06:06.133
has haunted me for years.

99
06:06.733 --> 06:08.433
I'm hoping you can answer it.

100
06:09.900 --> 06:11.233
Is that a demand?

101
06:12.666 --> 06:13.800
It's a request.

102
06:33.200 --> 06:34.900
My marriage to Song Yang

103
06:35.666 --> 06:37.266
was nothing but a deal.

104
06:40.133 --> 06:41.900
He gave me a child

105
06:42.233 --> 06:44.266
and I sent him to Singapore to study.

106
06:45.500 --> 06:46.966
What I never expected

107
06:47.633 --> 06:49.566
was that the fool fell in love with me.

108
06:50.466 --> 06:51.566
And just like that

109
06:52.333 --> 06:54.300
we stayed tangled up for eleven years.

110
06:55.000 --> 06:56.000
A deal?

111
06:56.133 --> 06:56.700
Yes.

112
06:57.100 --> 06:58.366
It was just a deal.

113
06:59.500 --> 07:00.500
So all these years

114
07:00.800 --> 07:02.533
it was you who kept them apart.

115
07:02.666 --> 07:03.666
It was you

116
07:04.000 --> 07:04.866
who denied them

117
07:04.867 --> 07:06.033
any news of each other?

118
07:06.166 --> 07:07.166
Yes.

119
07:07.800 --> 07:08.800
It was me.

120
07:09.039 --> 07:10.339
You don't have to love my dad,

121
07:11.066 --> 07:13.233
but my dad has every right to love his son.

122
07:13.966 --> 07:15.733
You know nothing about the past.

123
07:16.100 --> 07:17.332
Let alone understand it.

124
07:17.333 --> 07:17.733
Besides!

125
07:18.233 --> 07:20.533
You're in no position to judge me.

126
07:21.000 --> 07:23.266
You turned Xu Feiyu into a bargaining chip.

127
07:24.000 --> 07:25.033
All of this...

128
07:25.700 --> 07:27.266
wasn't it you who caused it?

129
07:29.833 --> 07:31.100
Objectively speaking,

130
07:31.666 --> 07:33.265
if not for my past mistakes,

131
07:33.266 --> 07:34.966
there'd be no you, would there?

132
07:35.333 --> 07:36.333
I...

133
07:36.400 --> 07:37.400
Song Yi.

134
07:38.600 --> 07:40.133
Put your curiosity away.

135
07:40.866 --> 07:43.299
What you really need to understand

136
07:43.300 --> 07:44.532
is that everything you do

137
07:44.533 --> 07:46.166
is hurting Xu Feiyu.

138
07:46.600 --> 07:48.399
I never meant to hurt him.

139
07:48.400 --> 07:50.666
You already have!

140
08:05.533 --> 08:06.533
Song Yi.

141
08:09.666 --> 08:10.666
Just go.

142
08:13.133 --> 08:14.933
Pretend none of this ever happened.

143
08:17.100 --> 08:20.300
I won't say a word about you and Song Yang.

144
08:24.700 --> 08:25.700
Is that a demand?

145
08:33.733 --> 08:34.733
This is a request.

146
08:52.333 --> 08:54.600
Xu Feiyu has a right to the truth.

147
08:55.000 --> 08:57.066
And my dad has the right to choose.

148
08:58.300 --> 08:59.733
You owe them that.

149
09:00.700 --> 09:02.166
And I owe them that too.

150
09:04.133 --> 09:05.166
Song Yi.

151
09:06.533 --> 09:07.866
Back then,

152
09:07.933 --> 09:09.266
you were still a child,

153
09:10.266 --> 09:11.800
just like Xu Feiyu.

154
09:13.133 --> 09:15.166
You couldn't choose anything.

155
09:15.633 --> 09:17.200
So you owe no one anything.

156
09:18.832 --> 09:19.832
It's just that...

157
09:20.433 --> 09:23.700
Xu Feiyu has suffered more than enough.

158
09:24.300 --> 09:25.100
So please, don't

159
09:25.101 --> 09:26.999
drag him into something more dangerous.

160
09:27.000 --> 09:28.000
All right?

161
09:29.600 --> 09:31.365
I just think that he and my dad

162
09:31.366 --> 09:32.400
have suffered enough.

163
09:32.733 --> 09:34.933
You're a good kid at heart.

164
09:35.533 --> 09:36.766
Take my advice.

165
09:37.033 --> 09:38.533
Don't play with fire here.

166
09:39.933 --> 09:40.933
I promise you.

167
09:41.533 --> 09:42.533
After you leave,

168
09:42.966 --> 09:43.933
little by little,

169
09:43.934 --> 09:45.400
I'll tell him everything.

170
09:45.833 --> 09:46.833
Does that work?

171
09:47.400 --> 09:49.033
Do you think it'll be that easy?

172
09:50.500 --> 09:52.300
My dad's been gone all these years,

173
09:52.866 --> 09:55.733
Xu Feiyu still thinks there's rats in the house.

174
09:59.400 --> 10:00.800
Could he really take that?

175
10:47.600 --> 10:49.099
Xu Feiyu.

176
10:49.100 --> 10:50.400
Your mom's still upstairs.

177
10:51.433 --> 10:52.966
Then we'll keep it down.

178
11:01.533 --> 11:02.533
What's wrong?

179
11:06.866 --> 11:09.606
I might have to leave.

180
11:09.966 --> 11:10.966
What happened?

181
11:12.100 --> 11:13.733
Did my mom say something to you?

182
11:15.633 --> 11:16.633
No.

183
11:17.400 --> 11:18.400
She's very kind.

184
11:19.500 --> 11:21.400
Then why leave so suddenly?

185
11:21.866 --> 11:23.266
I haven't even seen your face.

186
11:27.400 --> 11:28.766
I'm only a temporary carer.

187
11:30.066 --> 11:31.133
Your mom's back now.

188
11:32.400 --> 11:33.766
No real reason for me to stay.

189
11:35.300 --> 11:36.166
Then at least

190
11:36.167 --> 11:37.633
wait till my bandages come off.

191
11:38.900 --> 11:41.000
I want you to be the first person I see.

192
11:44.800 --> 11:45.866
I want to know

193
11:47.933 --> 11:49.966
if you look the way I imagined.

194
11:59.233 --> 12:00.766
You shouldn't get your hopes up.

195
12:01.766 --> 12:02.766
Probably

196
12:03.100 --> 12:04.133
I'd disappoint you.

197
12:05.833 --> 12:06.833
Why?

198
12:18.733 --> 12:19.733
Song Yi.

199
12:21.333 --> 12:21.833
Auntie.

200
12:21.966 --> 12:22.966
It's getting late.

201
12:23.533 --> 12:24.933
Go rest in the guest room.

202
12:25.600 --> 12:26.600
I'll take the couch.

203
12:27.433 --> 12:28.433
He might get up

204
12:29.300 --> 12:30.300
during the night.

205
12:33.300 --> 12:34.300
All right.

206
14:25.100 --> 14:26.266
Your mom's still here.

207
14:26.500 --> 14:27.733
She could come down anytime.

208
14:29.166 --> 14:30.166
Forget about her.

209
14:30.766 --> 14:33.299
She just flew all the way back from abroad.

210
14:33.300 --> 14:34.700
She'll be out cold.

211
14:56.333 --> 14:57.333
Mm…

212
15:50.733 --> 15:51.733
Mm.

213
16:08.433 --> 16:09.466
Xu Feiyu!

214
16:56.700 --> 16:57.700
Okay, okay.

215
16:57.900 --> 16:58.900
Enough.

216
16:59.500 --> 17:00.500
No…

217
17:00.633 --> 17:01.633
Ah!

218
17:02.733 --> 17:03.733
Ah!

219
17:06.266 --> 17:07.266
Xu Feiyu.

220
17:07.766 --> 17:09.300
Your mom's going to hear us.

221
17:10.866 --> 17:13.066
I'll admit I lost control a little.

222
17:14.166 --> 17:16.000
I do, every time I'm near you.

223
17:17.666 --> 17:19.033
Then reign it in a little.

224
17:20.566 --> 17:22.133
I can't hold back anymore.

225
17:22.266 --> 17:22.733
Mm.

226
17:22.833 --> 17:23.466
Mm…

227
17:23.666 --> 17:24.666
Just hold on.

228
17:26.600 --> 17:27.600
Ah!

229
17:27.733 --> 17:28.733
Mm.

230
17:29.033 --> 17:30.033
Mmm…

231
17:30.566 --> 17:31.566
Mm.

232
17:36.000 --> 17:37.000
Mm… mm.

233
17:53.700 --> 17:54.700
Okay.

234
17:55.100 --> 17:56.100
Enough for tonight.

235
17:56.766 --> 17:57.766
Go to sleep.

236
17:59.400 --> 18:00.400
Song Yi.

237
18:01.633 --> 18:04.100
Will you wait for the day my bandages come off?

238
18:06.633 --> 18:08.066
Don't be silly.

239
18:09.300 --> 18:10.565
When my bandages come off,

240
18:10.566 --> 18:12.133
I'm going to see you.

241
18:13.166 --> 18:14.166
That way,

242
18:14.500 --> 18:15.766
even if we're apart,

243
18:16.733 --> 18:19.033
I'll remember your face forever.

244
18:21.366 --> 18:22.366
Okay.

245
18:23.066 --> 18:24.066
Don't think so much.

246
18:24.600 --> 18:25.600
Let's sleep.

247
18:26.066 --> 18:27.066
Mm.
